            </p>
            <div class="landing-hero__cta-row">
                <a href="#schedule" class="landing__btn landing__btn--primary landing__btn--lg">
                    Take the tour again
                </a>
                <a href="mailto:sales@alectrone.com" class="landing__btn landing__btn--outline landing__btn--lg">
                    Email sales
                </a>
            </div>
